   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Trust Fund EBRD ll (2001)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den sv konsultfonden i EBRD uppr&#xe4;ttades 1991. Fonden &#xe4;r avsedd att    disponeras av EBRD f&#xf6;r att finansiera svenska kosulter i uppdrag f&#xf6;r  EBRD i anslutning till bankens verksamhet f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja              omvandlingsprocessen i EBRDs l&#xe5;ntagarl&#xe4;nder i Central- och &#xd6;steuropa.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish-EBRD Technical cooperation fund, established 1991. The fund   may be used by EBRD to engage swedish consultants for the development of EBRD finance projects and programs and other operations of EBRD in  the EBRD4s countries of operation.</narrative>
  </description>
